sequenceDiagram
    participant App as App Process
    participant WL as Wayland Server
    participant Comp as Compositor
    participant SG as SceneGraph
    participant VK as Vulkan

    App->>WL: wl_surface.commit(damage, dmabuf, sync)
    WL->>Comp: SurfaceCommit event
    Comp->>Comp: import dmabuf to VkImage
    Comp->>SG: markDirty(region)
    SG->>SG: incremental layout
    SG->>SG: buildDrawList()
    SG->>VK: record + submit + present
    WL->>App: wl_callback.done
